"""
`Road.Grip` and `Road.Slope` callables read from the packaged road files, evaluated along the
road's center line (y = 0) at a position that ramps from x = 420 m at t = 0 to x = 475 m at
t = 1 s.

`assets/data/roads/generate.jl` writes `ice_patch_mu.crg` with grip
1 - 0.7 smooth((x - 455)/4) smooth((495 - x)/4) on nodes every 0.5 m from x = 420 m, where
smooth clamps its argument to [0, 1]. Both ends are nodes, which the spline interpolates: at
x = 420 m the first factor is 0 and the grip is 1; at x = 475 m both factors are 1 and the grip
is 1 - 0.7 = 0.3.

It writes `ramp_z.crg` rising at 2 % along x from x = 0 to 500 m, then easing onto a plateau
over 500 to 540 m, level across. Neither 420 nor 475 m is a node, but the nodes are 40 m apart
from 0, so the spline's breaks, midway between nodes, include 500 and 540 m. The height is then
linear, quadratic and constant between breaks and C1, so it lies in the spline's space and
interpolation reproduces it exactly: on 0 to 500 m the fitted height is linear with derivative
0.02. Along the heading 0 the slope is 0.02 at both ends; along the heading pi/2, across the
level road, it is 0.
"""
test component Lookup
  "Grip of the ice-patch road"
  structural parameter grip::VehicleComponents.Road.Grip = VehicleComponents.Road.grip("dyad://VehicleComponents/data/roads/ice_patch_mu.crg")
  "Slope of the 2 % ramp road"
  structural parameter slope::VehicleComponents.Road.Slope = VehicleComponents.Road.slope("dyad://VehicleComponents/data/roads/ramp_z.crg")
  position = BlockComponents.Sources.Ramp(offset = 420.0, height = 55.0, duration = 1.0, start_time = 0.0) {
    "Dyad": {"placement": {"diagram": {"x1": 200, "x2": 300, "y1": 200, "y2": 300}}}
  }
  "Grip at the position"
  variable mu::Real
  "Slope at the position, heading along x"
  variable grade_along::Real
  "Slope at the position, heading along y"
  variable grade_across::Real
relations
  mu = grip(position.y, 0.0)
  grade_along = slope(position.y, 0.0, 0.0)
  grade_across = slope(position.y, 0.0, 1.5707963267948966)
metadata {
  "Dyad": {
    "tests": {
      "center_line": {
        "stop": 1,
        "solver": "Auto",
        "abstol": 1e-6,
        "reltol": 1e-6,
        "atol": {"mu": 1e-9, "grade_along": 1e-9, "grade_across": 1e-9},
        "expect": {
          "initial": {"mu": 1.0, "grade_along": 0.02, "grade_across": 0.0},
          "final": {"mu": 0.3, "grade_along": 0.02, "grade_across": 0.0}
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
end
